    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> Songhai Street, Baga Road, Maiduguri, Borno State, 600002</p>
    <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +234 70461 522 24</p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> bonadicksalminium@gmail.com</p>
